16
00:01:06,027 --> 00:01:10,486
einsteinium, nobelium, and argon, kryptonium, radon, xenon, zinc, and rhodium,

17
00:01:10,486 --> 00:01:14,104
and chlorine, carbon, cobalt, copper, tungsten, tin, and sodium.

18
00:01:14,104 --> 00:01:17,335
